  "solution": "The logic followed here is :** 2nd number - (1st number × 2) = Square root of 3rd number**\n\n**Given :**\n\n__\n \n• (17, 59, 625)\n\n​59 - **17 × 2**__ = sqrt{625} \n\n__**59 - 34**__ = 25\n\n25 = 25 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• (8, 44, 784)​\n\n​44 - **8** × 2__ = sqrt{784} \n\n__44 - 16__ = 28\n\n28 = 28 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : (22, 78, 784)​\n\n​78 - 22 × 2__ = sqrt{784} \n\n__78 - 44__ = 28\n\n**38 ≠ 28 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : (12, 69, 2025)​\n\n​69 - 12 × 2__ = sqrt{2025} \n\n__69 - 24__ = 45\n\n**45 = 45 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : (24, 70, 576)​\n\n​70 - 24 × 2__ = sqrt{576} \n\n__70 - 48__ = 24\n\n**22 **≠** 24 (LHS = RHS)**\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : (18, 74, 1296)​\n\n​74 - **1**8 × 2__ = sqrt{1296} \n\n__74 - 36__ = 36\n\n**38 ≠ 36 (LHS ≠ RHS)**\n\nHence, **\"Option - (2)\"** is the correct answer.\n\n74:T1498,\n<p styl",
